#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:10
#: dfd9b65551094e8a8c3e7a3c7ea13e7a
msgid ""
"This topic covers the wiring/connection of basic/mandatory peripherals to "
"the autopilot. For detailed explanations about each autopilot "
"port/connector, see :ref:`common-flight-controller-io`"
msgstr ""
"本主题介绍基本/必需外设与飞控的接线/连接。关于各飞控端口/连接器的详细说明，请参见 :ref:`common-flight-controller-"
