msgstr "连接蜂鸣器和安全开关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:114
#: 9cdcb36be414456b86bdfc2aa505c3c5
msgid ""
"The buzzer and safety switch button are optional, but useful for some "
"configurations. Not all autopilots provide these connections. A BUZZER and "
"SWITCH can be connected to their respective ports as shown."
msgstr "蜂鸣器和安全开关按钮是可选的，但在某些配置中很有用。并非所有飞控都提供这些接口。可将蜂鸣器和开关连接到各自的端口，如图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:121
#: e36b63a5e1814902ba5ff0f7ec751d20
